ion Close to Home","subtitle":"Residential study lounges in Assumption Hall","notes":"Residents can use the hall's study lounges for work away from their rooms; ask the front desk about guest access and current rules.","short_summary":"An on-site study alternative for students living in Duquesne's oldest residence hall.","evidence_claim":"Duquesne's official Assumption Hall page lists study and social lounges among the residence hall's amenities.","source_url":"https://www.duq.edu/life-at-duquesne/housing-and-dining/housing/assumpton-hall.php","source_title":"Assumption Hall","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Residential amenity inside Assumption Hall, which primarily houses first-year students. Confirm guest access at the security desk.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"duq-mcginley-study-collaboration-spaces","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"McGinley Hall Study and Collaboration Spaces","title":"Move the Group Project Downstairs","subtitle":"Study and collaboration areas in McGinley Hall","notes":"McGinley residents can shift group work out of their apartments; coordinate with the building desk before inviting nonresident partners.","short_summary":"Purpose-built collaboration areas within Duquesne's newer apartment-style student housing.","evidence_claim":"Duquesne's current facilities catalog says McGinley Hall includes student lounges and study/collaboration spaces and houses juniors, seniors and graduate students under eligible leases.","source_url":"https://www.duq.edu/academics/university-catalogs/2025-2026-catalog/graduate/about-duquesne/physical-facilities.php","source_title":"2025-2026 Graduate Catalog - Physical Facilities","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A r